{#
    One event, ranked or not, at the canonical `/tournament/{id}`.

    **A ranked page is exactly what it was.** Season context, the League points
    card and the leaderboard back link all stand; #92 must not alter one.

    An unranked page is option 3B, **archive first** — and on this page that
    turns out to mean the archive and nothing else.

    The League points card is not rendered for one. Not empty, not zeroed —
    absent, because there are no `TournamentResult` rows to fill it and no F1,
    bonus or total value exists anywhere on the event.

    **No separate finishing order either**, and the reason is worth keeping:
    the order an unranked event finished in *is* the ranking of its first
    stage, which the Swiss standings block below already renders — with the
    record, the form and the tiebreak columns this page would have dropped. A
    second table of the same entrants in the same order, minus columns, is a
    repetition rather than a summary; the only thing it could have added is the
    points, and there are none. The proposal drew `FINISHING-ORDER` here
    because it was drawing a page whose archive had not been built yet.

    It still earns its place on the import preview, where nothing is archived
    yet and it is the only statement of who finished where.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}{{ tournament.title }} | {{ tournament.ranked ? 'Standings' : 'Match archive' }}{% endblock %}

{% block accent_bar %}
    <div class="h-2 bg-linear-to-r from-flame-strong via-heat-strong to-brand-strong"></div>
{% endblock %}

{% block body %}

    {# An unranked event has no season leaderboard to go back to, so it goes
       back to the archive — which is the page that files it. #}
    {% if tournament.ranked %}
        <twig:BackLink href="{{ path('season_leaderboard', {'slug': current_season.slug}) }}" class="mb-6">
            Return to {{ current_season.name }} leaderboard
        </twig:BackLink>
    {% else %}
        <twig:BackLink href="{{ path('tournament_archive') }}" class="mb-6">
            Return to the tournament archive
        </twig:BackLink>
    {% endif %}

    <twig:Flashes />

    <twig:PageHeader
        eyebrow="{{ tournament.ranked ? 'Official event record' : 'Unranked tournament' }}"
        eyebrowTone="{{ tournament.ranked ? 'flame' : 'neutral' }}"
        title="{{ tournament.title }}"
        size="md"
    >
        <p class="font-mono">
            Challonge url:
            <a href="{{ tournament.challongeUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
               class="text-brand transition-colors hover:text-brand-bright">{{ tournament.challongeUrl }}</a>
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono">Held on {{ tournament.heldOn|date('Y-m-d') }}</p>
        <p class="font-mono">{{ tournament.ranked ? current_season.name : 'No season · scores nothing' }}</p>
    </twig:PageHeader>

    {% if not tournament.ranked %}
        <twig:Alert tone="neutral" class="mb-6" data-page-section="unranked-notice">
            This event is archived in full and awards no league points. Its matches count
            towards every blader's record and towards the league records board; its finishing
            order scores nothing, and no result row exists for it.
        </twig:Alert>
    {% endif %}

    {% if teams %}
        {# A 2v2 event. The entrants are teams, so the finishing order is
           theirs — and an unclaimed team appears here and nowhere else,
           because it has no placement to appear in the standings with. #}
        <twig:Card class="mb-6">
            <twig:SectionHeading title="Teams" size="md" tone="flame" />

            <twig:DataTable>
                <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th class="w-16 text-center">Rank</th>
                    <th>Team</th>
                    <th>Bladers</th>
                </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                {% for team in teams %}
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center">
                            <twig:RankMedal :rank="team.rank" />
                        </td>
                        <td class="font-bold text-ink">{{ team.name }}</td>
                        <td>
                            {% if team.claimed %}
                                {% for blader in team.bladers %}
                                    <a href="{{ path('player_page', {'slug': blader.slug}) }}"
                                       class="font-semibold text-ink transition-colors outline-none hover:text-brand focus:text-brand">
                                        {{ blader.name }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}<span class="text-ink-faint"> + </span>{% endif %}
                                {% endfor %}
                            {% else %}
                                <twig:Badge tone="neutral" size="sm">Unclaimed</twig:Badge>
                            {% endif %}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </twig:DataTable>
        </twig:Card>
    {% endif %}

    {# Absent rather than empty for an unranked event: there is no
       `TournamentResult` row behind it and a zeroed table would be the lie the
       invariant exists to prevent. #}
    {% if tournament.ranked %}
    <twig:Card class="mb-6" data-page-section="league-points">
        <twig:SectionHeading title="League points" size="md" tone="flame" />
        <twig:ExpandableTable :initialRows="5">
        <twig:DataTable>
            <thead>
            <tr>
                <th class="w-16 text-center">Rank</th>
                <th>Blader name</th>
                <th class="text-center">Base F1 pts</th>
                <th class="pr-4 text-right font-bold text-brand">Total</th>
            </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
            {% for row in standings %}
                <tr>
                    <td class="text-center">
                        <twig:RankMedal :rank="row.rank" />
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <a href="{{ path('player_page', {'slug': row.player_slug}) }}"
                               class="font-bold text-ink transition-colors outline-none hover:text-brand focus:text-brand">
                                {{ row.player_name }}
                            </a>
                            {% if row.bonus_points > 0 %}<twig:BonusPoints :value="row.bonus_points" chip />{% endif %}
                        </span>
                    </td>
                    <td class="text-center">{{ row.f1_points }}</td>
                    <td class="pr-4 text-right font-black text-ink">
                        {{ row.total_points }} <span class="text-xs font-normal text-ink-faint">pts</span>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            {% else %}
                <tr>
                    <td colspan="4" class="py-12 text-center text-sm italic text-ink-faint">No match details recorded for this tournament.</td>
                </tr>
            {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </twig:DataTable>
        </twig:ExpandableTable>
    </twig:Card>
    {% endif %}

    {% if archive.archived %}
        {% for cut in archive.cuts %}
            <twig:Card class="mb-6" data-page-section="top-cut">
                <twig:TopCut :paths="cut.paths" :columns="cut.columns" :matchCount="cut.match_count" />
            </twig:Card>
        {% endfor %}

        {% for swiss in archive.swiss %}
            <twig:Card class="mb-6" data-page-section="swiss-standings">
                <twig:SectionHeading title="{{ swiss.label }} standings" size="md" tone="brand" />
                <p class="mb-4 text-xs text-ink-muted">{{ swiss.stage.name ?: swiss.label ~ ' stage' }} · {{ swiss.stage.rounds }} rounds · {{ swiss.standings|length }} entrants</p>

                <twig:ExpandableTable :initialRows="5">
                <twig:DataTable compact bleed>
                    <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th class="w-12 text-center">Rank</th>
                        <th>Blader</th>
                        <th class="text-center">Match history</th>
                        <th class="text-center">W-L-T-B</th>
                        {% for column in swiss.columns %}
                            <th class="hidden text-center sm:table-cell"{% if column.title %} title="{{ column.title }}"{% endif %}>{{ column.label }}</th>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                    {% for row in swiss.standings %}
                        {% set entrant = row.participant %}
                        <tr>
                            <td class="text-center">{% if entrant.stageRank %}<twig:RankMedal :rank="entrant.stageRank" />{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
                            <td class="font-bold text-ink">{{ entrant.player ? entrant.player.name : entrant.name|replace({' (invitation pending)': ''}) }}</td>
                            <td class="text-center"><twig:FormStrip :results="row.form" /></td>
                            <td class="whitespace-nowrap text-center font-mono">{{ entrant.wins ?? '—' }}-{{ entrant.losses ?? '—' }}-{{ entrant.ties ?? 0 }}-{{ entrant.byes ?? 0 }}</td>
                            {% for column in swiss.columns %}
                                {% set value = attribute(entrant, column.key) %}
                                <td class="hidden text-center sm:table-cell">{{ column.key == 'pointsDifferential' and value > 0 ? '+' ~ value : value ?? '—' }}</td>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                    </tbody>
                </twig:DataTable>
                </twig:ExpandableTable>
            </twig:Card>

        {% endfor %}

        {% for swiss in archive.swiss %}
            <twig:Card class="mb-6" data-page-section="swiss-rounds">
                <twig:SectionHeading title="{{ swiss.label }} rounds" size="md" tone="brand" />
                <div class="space-y-3" data-swiss-rounds>
                    {% for round in swiss.rounds %}
                        {% set roundSummary = 'Round ' ~ round.number ~ ' · ' ~ (round.matches|length) ~ ' matches' %}
                        {% if round.byes %}{% set roundSummary = roundSummary ~ ' · ' ~ (round.byes|length) ~ ' ' ~ (round.byes|length == 1 ? 'bye' : 'byes') %}{% endif %}
                        <twig:Disclosure summary="{{ roundSummary }}" tone="neutral" compact data-swiss-round="{{ round.number }}">
                            <twig:MatchLog :rows="round.matches" :byes="round.byes" strikeLoser />
                        </twig:Disclosure>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            </twig:Card>
        {% endfor %}
    {% else %}
        <twig:Card class="mb-6">
            {# A 2v2 event is not waiting to be archived: a team match records only the
               aggregate of its individual matchups, so there is no blader-level result
               to hold. Saying "not yet" about it would be a promise nothing can keep. #}
            {% if tournament.teamEvent %}
                <twig:EmptyState title="No match archive for a 2v2 event">
                    A team match records only the aggregate of its individual matchups, so there is no blader-level result to archive. The teams and their placings are above.
                </twig:EmptyState>
            {% elseif tournament.ranked %}
                <twig:EmptyState title="Match archive not available">
                    League points remain official. The full bracket will appear here when this tournament is archived.
                </twig:EmptyState>
            {% else %}
                <twig:EmptyState icon="🗂️" title="Nothing archived for this event">
                    An unranked tournament is kept for its matches, and this one has none yet.
                </twig:EmptyState>
            {% endif %}
        </twig:Card>
    {% endif %}

{% endblock %}
